{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — Yoga hidden (29 September 2026, Ivan: "hide all
  yoga-related parts so that users can't see them. don't remove them").

  Rendered in <head>. While Theme settings > Show Yoga is off, a yoga
  collection page (/collections/yoga and the other yoga collections) sends
  the visitor on to the Collection Index and asks search engines not to
  index it. The page, its template and its collection are untouched; ticking
  Show Yoga brings it straight back. Never in the theme editor, so the
  template can still be opened and edited there.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless settings.ha_show_yoga or request.design_mode -%}
  {%- assign yoga_handle = collection.handle | downcase -%}
  {%- if template.name == 'collection' and yoga_handle contains 'yoga' -%}
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url={{ routes.collections_url }}">
    <script>window.location.replace({{ routes.collections_url | json }});</script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endunless -%}
